{"3349770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stormwater - Complete Edition", "steam_appid": 3349770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stormwater Fuses the genres of Classic Shooting Games with Point and Click Adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now in exile, the only work left for Prussy the Sailor is at a parish in the haunted countryside of a foreign land. With his old friend Priest Grail, together they must guide the spirit of their town and lift the many curses that plague the continent- or else fall, packed down into dark earth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/b3d38fdeccb5b52e314cce52dc770cea.poster.avif?t=1735578634\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/b3d38fdeccb5b52e314cce52dc770cea.webm?t=1735578634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop</strong> relationships with the strangers of the continent, as you strive to fulfill your duty for the church, guarding the spiritual welfare of the town of Perinthia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/146206c52b11108d1ea086b9f609713d.poster.avif?t=1735578634\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/146206c52b11108d1ea086b9f609713d.webm?t=1735578634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> dark curses that range from spirits haunting forgotten homes, to the cruel possessions of entire towns, and even the ineffable horrors buried deep beneath the earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/384f28e3b8f521c79d46477bb1cfd091.poster.avif?t=1735578634\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/384f28e3b8f521c79d46477bb1cfd091.webm?t=1735578634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slay</strong> hordes of darkness. Whatever comes their way, Priest Grail and Prussy the Sailor are always ready to shoot, kick, burn, slice, and blow to pieces their enemies. Curses or otherwise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stormwater Fuses the genres of Classic Shooting Games with Point and Click Adventure.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now in exile, the only work left for Prussy the Sailor is at a parish in the haunted countryside of a foreign land. With his old friend Priest Grail, together they must guide the spirit of their town and lift the many curses that plague the continent- or else fall, packed down into dark earth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/b3d38fdeccb5b52e314cce52dc770cea.poster.avif?t=1735578634\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349770/extras/b3d38fdeccb5